track borrowing records, calculate fines, download study materials,
and access library resources anytime.

</p>

<button class="btn">Explore Library</button>

</div>

<div class="hero-image">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512820790803-83ca734da794?w=700">

</div>

</div>

<section>

<h1 class="title">Library Overview</h1>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<h1>15K+</h1>
<p>Books Available</p>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<h1>2500+</h1>
<p>Students</p>
</div>

<div class="stat">
