<li>Modern User Interface</li>

<li>Fast Navigation</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section>

<h1 class="title">Find Your Book</h1>

<div class="search">

<input type="text" placeholder="Search by Book Title, Author or ISBN">

<button class="btn">Search</button>

</div>

</section>

<section id="materials">

<h1 class="title">Academic Materials</h1>

<div class="materials">

<div class="material">

<h3>📖 First Year</h3>

<p>Semester 1 & Semester 2 Study Materials</p>

<button class="btn">Download</button>

</div>

<div class="material">

<h3>💻 Second Year</h3>

<p>Programming, DSA, Database Systems</p>

<button class="btn">Download</button>

</div>

<div class="material">

<h3>🌐 Third Year</h3>

<p>Web Development, AI, Cloud Computing</p>

<button class="btn">Download</button>

</div>

<div class="material">

<h3>🎓 Final Year</h3>

<p>Capstone Projects & Placement Resources</p>

<button class="btn">Download</button>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="contact">

<h1 class="title">Contact Library</h1>

<div class="contact">

<div>

<h2 style="margin-bottom:20px;color:#00ffff;">Library Information</h2>

<p style="line-height:35px;font-size:18px;">

📍 Saveetha School of Engineering<br><br>

📞 +91 9876543210<br><br>

📧 library@college.edu<br><br>

